## 8. Roadmap

- [ ] Cost-sensitive thresholds (expected-cost curves) per domain
- [ ] Native anomaly detectors (IsolationForest, LOF, One-Class SVM) as a baseline group
- [ ] Cross-validation + confidence intervals on all metrics
- [ ] Calibration curves & Brier scores
- [ ] CI workflow to regenerate reports on push

