## Documentation layout

- `core/README.md` is a hand-authored narrative (one README for the whole `core/`
  package). Its structure and voice follow `spam_fraud_detector/reports/docs/CORE_README_STYLE.md`.
- Run `make docs-check-core` after any edit to `core/README.md` or to any
  `spam_fraud_detector/core/*.py`. The pre-commit hook runs the same check.
- Editing `core/README.md`? Run `make docs-check-core` or the pre-commit hook
  will fail.

